        "temperament": "Stupid",
        "wild": "Ovis arcam is perhaps the most oblivious creature on the Island. It wanders without purpose or apparent awareness of its surroundings, seemingly incapable of recognizing danger until it is far too late. It is completely non-aggressive and will not even attempt to flee from predators.",
